1577
01:32:54,783 --> 01:32:55,951
-Hola.
-Hola.

1578
01:32:56,034 --> 01:32:57,619
-Dadme las bolsas.
-Sí, toma.

1579
01:32:57,703 --> 01:32:58,871
-¿Dónde está?
-Hola.

1580
01:32:58,954 --> 01:33:00,622
-Hola, cariño.
-Papá.

1581
01:33:01,957 --> 01:33:03,000
Feliz Navidad.

1582
01:33:03,083 --> 01:33:04,251
Feliz Navidad.

1583
01:33:04,334 --> 01:33:06,545
